1. A method of playing a live casino game, comprising dealing cards or dice to at least one player according to a set of conventional casino game rules to provide a conventional casino table game, allowing at least one player to place a bet on the conventional casino table game to provide a first player, granting a right of first refusal to place a bet on jackpot to the first player by virtue of the first player's bet on the casino game, allowing the first player to exercise the right of first refusal to bet on the jackpot or at least a second player to place a bet on the jackpot if the first player declines the right to place a bet on the jackpot, wherein the second player is at a betting terminal that is apart from the conventional casino table game, determining the outcome of the conventional casino table game according to the set of conventional casino game rules, and
determining the outcome of the jackpot according to a combination of cards or dice in the conventional casino table game.
2. The method of claim 1, wherein the conventional casino table game is a felt table game.
3. The method of claim 1, wherein the conventional casino table game is a Roulette game, a Black Jack & Craps game, a Sic Bo game, a showhand game or a Fish-Prawn-Crab game.
4. The method of claim 1, wherein the set of conventional casino game rules are Las Vegas baccarat rules or Macau baccarat rules.
5. The method of claim 1, wherein the bet on the conventional casino table game is a bet on a live baccarat game selected from the group consisting of a bet on player hand win, a bet on bank hand win, a tie bet, a bet on player pair, and a bet on bank pair, where the bet on player hand win or the bet on bank hand win can combine with any or all of the tie bet, the bet on player pair and the bet on bank pair.
6. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of cards that comprises A, K, Q, J, and 10, regardless of the suit.
7. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of cards that comprises A, K, Q, J, 10 in spade, regardless of the sequence.
8. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of cards that comprises K, Q, J, 10 in spade and A in either heart, club or diamond, regardless of the sequence.
9. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of cards selected from:
Spade A plus K,Q,J,10 in Heart, Club or Diamond;
Heart A plus K,Q,J,10 in Spade, Club or Diamond;
Club A plus K,Q,J,10 in Spade, Heart or Diamond; or Diamond A plus K, Q, J, 10 in Spade, Heart, or Club.
10. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of 5 cards of a kind.
11. The method of claim 1, wherein the jackpot is won by a combination of 6 cards of a kind.
12. The method of claim 1, wherein determining the outcome of the jackpot comprises determining the outcome of the jackpot according to Rule (I), which provides that the jackpot is won if any of the following is met:
