  "text": "3. The shaft assembly according to claim 2, wherein the shaft assembly has a straight configuration, and an angled configuration, between about 0\u00b0 to about 90\u00b0, wherein the distal neck housing is pivoted about the pivot pin to a desired angled configuration."
